  "intuition": "Create a bounded number of clear objective-based comparisons per instance by pairing best-vs-worst, best-vs-mid, mid-vs-worst, then filling remaining budget with symmetric head-vs-tail rank pairs; this yields deterministic, stratified supervision while capping pair count.",
  "implementation_hint": {
